{"id": "EUVD-2026-98935", "enisaUuid": "b4f60abf-d1c5-31bf-8cd5-3951af4fc22e", "description": "Powerlevel10k through 1.20.0 contains an insecure download vulnerability in the gitstatus/install script that disables TLS certificate verification with curl -k and skips integrity checks when no SHA-256 utility exists. Network-positioned attackers can intercept the github.com mirror request and substitute a malicious archive, which runs as the gitstatusd daemon under the user's account on every prompt.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T16:53:05", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T15:43:53", "baseScore": 7.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/romkatv/powerlevel10k/issues/2970", "https://github.com/romkatv/powerlevel10k/blob/v1.20.0/gitstatus/install#L306-L333", "https://github.com/romkatv/powerlevel10k/blob/v1.20.0/gitstatus/install#L348", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/powerlevel10k-through-1.20.0-download-of-code-without-integrity-check-in-gitstatus-installer"], "aliases": ["GHSA-hvg4-58mj-cjjc", "CVE-2026-110102"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.12, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "9ce3b2de-98e0-3a9a-82bd-1580edff7141", "product": {"name": "powerlevel10k", "vendor": {"name": "romkatv"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.20.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "99d84fea-c1ab-30e6-a765-baf02d23d26b", "vendor": {"name": "romkatv"}}], "isExploited": false}